---
// src/components/sections/IpSafeguards.astro
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-brand-dark relative border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute top-12 left-12 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-glow/5 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
            
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:sticky lg:top-32">
                <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight tracking-tight">
                    How ZetaLogix Safeguards Your <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-accent to-brand-glow">Intellectual Property</span>
                </h2>
            </div>

            <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-12">
                
                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                        </svg>
                        Privacy Protection with NDA
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                        ZetaLogix enforces strict non-disclosure agreements to safeguard your sensitive information. Our policies are regularly updated to incorporate the latest security practices, ensuring your intellectual property remains protected at all times.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                        </svg>
                        Transparent Agreements
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                        We value clarity and simplicity in our agreements. ZetaLogix ensures all corporate contracts are straightforward, with no hidden clauses, maintaining absolute operational transparency throughout our entire engagement.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                        </svg>
                        Business Ethics and Reputation
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                        At ZetaLogix, we uphold the highest ethical standards in all our global business practices. We are deeply committed to protecting your corporate reputation as well as ours, ensuring that our partnership enhances your public image.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <h3 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-accent shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                        </svg>
                        Ownership of Deliverables
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                        ZetaLogix believes in full client ownership of all project deliverables. From the initial system design to the final optimized production code, everything we construct for your enterprise is entirely yours to keep.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
            
        </div>
    </div>
</section>